#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/dressed\\_box.drawio.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/dressed_box.drawio.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/dressed\\_box.drawio.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/dressed_box.drawio.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Circuit with twirl, basis change, and inject noise directives.\n"
msgstr "트윌, 기저 변경, 노이즈 주입 디렉티브가 있는 회로.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gates on the side of the dressing that are compatible with the dressing’s template parametrization can be composed into it, reducing the number of physical gates. These are called *easy* gates. The remainder of the box is called *hard* and is implemented as is.\n"
msgstr "드레싱의 템플릿 매개변수화와 호환되는 드레싱 쪽의 게이트는 드레싱에 합성할 수 있으며, 이로써 물리적 게이트 수가 줄어듭니다. 이러한 게이트를 *easy* 게이트라고 합니다. 박스의 나머지 부분은 *hard*라고 하며 그대로 구현됩니다.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/dressed\\_box\\_uncollected.drawio.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/dressed_box_uncollected.drawio.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/dressed\\_box\\_uncollected.drawio.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/dressed_box_uncollected.drawio.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples of circuits with hanging virtual gates. The virtual gates on the opposite side of the dressing have nowhere to be implemented.\n"
msgstr "가상 게이트가 남아 있는 회로의 예. 드레싱 반대편의 가상 게이트는 구현될 곳이 없습니다.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/dressed\\_box\\_collected.drawio.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/dressed_box_collected.drawio.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/dressed\\_box\\_collected.drawio.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/dressed_box_collected.drawio.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples of circuits where all virtual gates are composed into dressings. Measurements have Pauli gates composed in by accounting for the bitflip they induce.\n"
msgstr "모든 가상 게이트가 드레싱에 합성된 회로의 예. 측정에는 측정이 유발하는 비트 플립을 고려하여 Pauli 게이트가 합성됩니다.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/dressed\\_box\\_mixed\\_collect.drawio.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/dressed_box_mixed_collect.drawio.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/dressed\\_box\\_mixed\\_collect.drawio.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/dressed_box_mixed_collect.drawio.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complex example where all virtual gates are collected. Virtual gates generated by one box can be composed into different dressings.\n"
msgstr "모든 가상 게이트가 수집되는 복잡한 예. 한 박스에서 생성된 가상 게이트는 서로 다른 드레싱에 합성될 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This allows for constructions where dressed boxes do not need to have the same width.\n"
msgstr "이로써 드레스드 박스의 너비가 같지 않아도 되는 구성이 가능합니다.\n"
